cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BaSingSeCriptografy — RSD-S (Riemann Spectral Diffusion): Cryptographic Primitive Prototype & Formal Cryptanalysis Workbench"
message: "If you use this cryptographic research package, CNF/SMT models, or test vectors in your research or pedagogy, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ludgero"
    given-names: "Danilo"
